From 9106fc04c4d101517399bf66066416c6ff40ac79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JoshuaHayesWasHere <josh.hayes121@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:10:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): a jstack task's crew idle while its pull request
 waits says stalled and for how long, and a held one says held for how long
 and why

The server reads jmerge's holds from waiting-on-user.json and jbus's from
held.json onto each task.
The tree draws quiet, stalled or held with an age beside the stage word, and
a hold's reason on hover and at the head of the row's menu.
